<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The scripture God has breathed,</l><l>So I must breathe it in.</l><l>Unveiling thus received,</l><l>Convicting me within.</l><l>Such revelation…</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The veils fall from my eyes,</l><l>Myself I see, abhor.</l><l>Exposed I just confess,</l><l>I’m crooked, wrong, and short.</l><l>The blood is washing…</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Corrected, I’m restored,</l><l>And made upright again.</l><l>The revelation yields</l><l>Sweet fruits of righteousness.</l><l>I love His shining…</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Instructed in the light,</l><l>From Christ’s enlight’ning word,</l><l>Rebuilding over time,</l><l>My heart by life restored.</l><l>He’s making home there…</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>O living Spirit-sword,</l><l>Apply Yourself to me.</l><l>Pierce through, even divide,</l><l>My soul and spirit freed.</l><l>So I can live You…</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>So take the word by prayer,</l><l>The Spirit to apply,</l><l>The foes and germs are slain</l><l>With flesh and self thereby.</l><l>To walk in newness…</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>So nourish me today,</l><l>My Breath and living Bread.</l><l>Come live through me I pray,</l><l>And soon come back again!</l><l>Yes, come Lord Jesus!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
